{"title": "Israeli Parliament Elects Opposition-Backed Speaker", "summary": "Israel's parliament, the Knesset, has elected Matan Kahana, an ally of Benny Gantz's National Unity party, as its new speaker. Kahana secured the position with support from the opposition bloc. This development is seen as a significant setback for Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu's Likud party, which had backed a different candidate. The vote for speaker had faced potential delays due to concerns from the Eisenkot bloc about a Likud-backed filibuster. The election of Kahana places a powerful role in the hands of the opposition.", "summary_points": [], "title_hi": "इज़राइली संसद ने विपक्ष समर्थित स्पीकर का चुनाव किया", "summary_hi": "इज़राइल की संसद, क्नेसेट ने बेनी गैंट्ज़ की नेशनल यूनिटी पार्टी के सहयोगी मातन काहाना को अपना नया स्पीकर चुना है। काहाना ने विपक्ष के समर्थन से यह पद हासिल किया। इस विकास को प्रधानमंत्री बेंजामिन नेतन्याहू की लिकुड पार्टी के लिए एक महत्वपूर्ण झटका माना जा रहा है, जिसने एक अलग उम्मीदवार का समर्थन किया था। स्पीकर के चुनाव में लिकुड समर्थित फ़िलिबस्टर की चिंताओं के कारण संभावित देरी का सामना करना पड़ा था। काहाना का चुनाव विपक्ष के हाथों में एक शक्तिशाली भूमिका रखता है।", "summary_points_hi": [], "framing": {"left": ["Highlights the opposition's powerful role following the election of Matan Kahana as speaker."], "center": ["Reports the election of Matan Kahana, an ally of Eisenkot and opposition-backed, as the new Knesset speaker.", "Notes the election is a blow to Netanyahu."], "right": ["Frames the election of the opposition-backed speaker as a major blow to Prime Minister Netanyahu.", "Mentions the vote was at risk of delay due to fears of a Likud-backed filibuster."]}, "framing_hi": {"left": ["स्पीकर के रूप में मातन काहाना के चुनाव के बाद विपक्ष की शक्तिशाली भूमिका पर प्रकाश डालता है।"], "center": ["आइज़नकोट के सहयोगी और विपक्ष समर्थित मातन काहाना के नए क्नेसेट स्पीकर के रूप में चुनाव की रिपोर्ट करता है।", "चुनाव को नेतन्याहू के लिए एक झटका बताता है।"], "right": ["विपक्ष समर्थित स्पीकर के चुनाव को प्रधानमंत्री नेतन्याहू के लिए एक बड़ा झटका बताता है।", "जिक्र करता है कि लिकुड समर्थित फ़िलिबस्टर के डर से वोट में देरी का खतरा था।"]}, "topic": "Politics", "region": "World", "published_at": null, "image_url": "", "sources": [{"source": "Al Jazeera English", "owner": "Al Jazeera English", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "As Knesset readies for new speaker, Israeli opposition holds powerful role", "url_kind": "google_news_wrapper"}, {"source": "Al Jazeera English", "owner": "Al Jazeera English", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Is Israel’s Eisenkot bloc less right wing than Netanyahu?", "url_kind": "google_news_wrapper"}, {"source": "France 24", "owner": "France 24", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "🔴Israeli parliament elects Eisenkot ally Matan Kahana as new Knesset speaker", "publisher_url": "https://www.france24.com/en/middle-east/20261117-%F0%9F%94%B4-israeli-parliament-elects-eisenkot-ally-matan-kahana-as-speaker", "url_kind": "publisher_verified"}, {"source": "Times Now", "owner": "Times Now", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Netanyahu Suffers Major Blow As Opposition Captures Knesset Speaker's Post", "url_kind": "google_news_wrapper"}, {"source": "The Globe and Mail", "owner": "The Globe and Mail", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxOV2FiRWhxclQzR3ZoUkFaUkFhdll6MWFfeTJjbWM0OGRIYVNqUTNnOTVtaVRwdjdXXzRRbTFpTHJ4YjZ2ckUtLVZQRVdGWVQ4SU00TklWRENOSFExanVlWUZUR2k4ZWhlNFJTaVhfQXRMaDN0RHptMkU1eW1UR3c0WGYzR3V4N2hyazl2amlWb0FsX082Ujc5UkhQUzB6cTVjWUNrVEJvZEFLX3hyLUhv?oc=5", "headline": "Israeli parliament elects opposition-backed Matan Kahana as new speaker", "url_kind": "google_news_wrapper"}, {"source": "The Japan Times", "owner": "The Japan Times", "lean": "center", "langu